.claude/.gitignore.local
.mcp.json
*.log
coverage/
.perf-baseline/
# v1.30-1 kept `.a11y-baseline/` ignored while stubs were in flight; v1.30-2
# lands real 3-layer baselines so per-package `.a11y-baseline/<pkg>.json`
# files are tracked from here on (folder stays writable).
.stryker-tmp/
mutation-report/
.DS_Store
examples/*/cache/
examples/*/forge-out/build-info/
examples/*/.next/
examples/*/.env.local
examples/*/.env
examples/*/dist/
examples/*/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
examples/*/.context/
examples/*/lcov.info
# Every dogfood example's `pnpm test` rewrites `quality-report/fidelity-latest.{json,md}`.
# `reportedAt` changes on every run, and ten of them also carry wall-clock latency
# (`p50Ms` / `p95Ms` / `p99Ms`) that lands on a different float each time. 27 examples
# ignored the path in their own `.gitignore`; 34 committed it, so a full test run left 56
# modified files behind and a `git add -A` swept them into whatever was being committed.
# The reviewed snapshot a release depends on is promoted by hand to
# `docs/quality-reports/<domain>/<name>.md`, which stays tracked. Nothing reads the
# per-example copy.
examples/*/quality-report/

# Local-only context (markers / spec drafts / scratch)
.context/

# JetBrains IDE (IntelliJ IDEA / WebStorm / PyCharm 等)
.idea/
*.iml

# VSCode (project-level settings は per-team で commit する場合もあるが、
# default では除外し、 必要な settings は別途明示 commit する方針)
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# Windows OS metadata
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Vim / Emacs / 一般エディタの swap / temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Backup / temp files
*.bak
*.tmp
.tmp/

# tsup が config を bundle する際に生成する一時 file。 実行ごとに別名 (ランダム
# suffix) で残り、 中身は tsup.config.ts の transpile 結果でしかない。
tsup.config.bundled_*.mjs

# Stryker mutation report
mutation-report/
.stryker-tmp/

kiwa-py/.venv/

